==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[jestʲ]|lang=ru}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{proto|Slavic|(j)ěsti|lang=ru}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|*h₁ed-|to eat|lang=ru}}.

====Verb====
'''есть''' (jest’) ''[[impf.]]'', [[съесть]] (s"jest’) ''[[pf.]]'', [[поесть]] (pojést’) ''[[pf.]]''

# to [[eat]] (something)

