===Etymology 2===
From {{proto|Slavic|(j)estъ|lang=ru}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|h₁ést|lang=ru}}.

====Verb====
'''есть''' (jest’)
: ''([[present tense|present]] [[indicative mood|indicative]] of the verb '''''[[быть]]''''')''

# [[am]], [[is]], [[are]]
# [[there is]], [[there are]]
# [[have]], [[has]]

====Interjection====
'''есть''' (jest’)

# [[all right]]
# [[okay]], [[right]], [[roger]]
# {{military|lang=ru}} [[yessir]]!
# ''(naval)'' [[aye|aye-aye]]!

